    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in any phase, straight after you roll one of these for one of your units or models: a [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls), [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls), [Save](vsdata:core-rule/save-rolls), Damage, [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move), Charge or [Hazard](vsdata:core-rule/hazard-rolls) roll, or the roll that sets how many attacks a weapon makes. That unit or model is the target: roll that roll again. If it used several dice together, pick just one die to re-roll, except a [Charge roll](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step), where every die must be re-rolled. As with every Stratagem, you [cannot use it again in the same phase](vsdata:core-rule/using-stratagems).",
